---
title "Install Cascadia Mono (intent playbook)"
---

= Install Cascadia Mono

DevCentr Appearance **default**. Mono, not Cascadia *Code* (no ligatures).

Same file on every OS. PlayTime binds `cli.install` for tool `cascadia-mono`.

Need a catalog: `--catalog` pointing at `equivalence-rules-cli/catalog/tools.sdl`
(or `SCRIPTBOOK_CATALOG`). Pass `--format brew` / `nix` / `choco` when several methods fit.

::: playbook [id="install-cascadia-mono" shell="auto"]

::: choose [id="pkg-format" prompt="How should we install Cascadia Mono?" intent="cli.install" tool="cascadia-mono"]
:::

::: step [id="install" intent="cli.install" tool="cascadia-mono" bind="pkg-format" confirm=true]
:::

:::
